    <desc id="first-refusal-desc">The chance of a first refusal is 8.9, 9.1, 8.6, 12.4, 9.3 and 8.8 percent across six turns — essentially flat. The share of dialogues that have refused at least once climbs from 8.9 to 26.4 percent over the same turns.</desc>
