  <figcaption><span class="figure-title">A flat hazard and a rising total.</span> Green: among dialogues that have not yet refused, the chance of refusing on this turn. Pooled over 4,328 at-risk turns and centred within intent and turn, so neither the request nor the depth can confound it. Red: the share of all 909 dialogues that have refused at least once. Turn index predicts a first refusal at AUC 0.490, which is chance.</figcaption>
</figure>
